1. CLICK selector: "Accounts"
2. CLICK selector: "the account matching <account_ref>"
3. CLICK selector: "filter icon"
4. SELECT field: view, option: "Transactions"
5. SELECT field: from_date, option: "<from_date>"
6. SELECT field: to_date, option: "<to_date>"
7. SELECT field: transaction_type, option: "All"
8. NOTE The date-range picker is limited to a rolling recent window. Record the actual earliest available date in the capture limitations.
9. CLICK selector: "DOWNLOAD TRANSACTIONS"
10. DOWNLOAD as: "AccountHistory_<account_ref>.csv", format: csv
